1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,760
Why are we still guessing our paychecks

2
00:00:01,659 --> 00:00:02,500
before applying?

3
00:00:02,833 --> 00:00:05,173
For years, applicants have faced a stubborn

4
00:00:05,073 --> 00:00:06,033
wall of secrecy.

5
00:00:06,559 --> 00:00:08,799
I saw the listing! It just said 'competitive

6
00:00:08,699 --> 00:00:10,179
salary.' Seriously?

7
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:12,781
That is standard code for 'we will offer

8
00:00:12,681 --> 00:00:13,760
you almost nothing.'

9
00:00:13,972 --> 00:00:15,852
But how would we even know if it covers

10
00:00:15,753 --> 00:00:16,313
