65
00:01:57,222 --> 00:01:59,482
Enforcement details haven't been set yet.

66
00:01:59,676 --> 00:02:02,016
Voluntarily encouraged until the law actually

67
00:02:01,916 --> 00:02:02,376
passes?

68
00:02:02,724 --> 00:02:04,584
This is shaping up to be a slow rollout!

69
00:02:04,943 --> 00:02:06,763
The government promises further measures

70
00:02:06,663 --> 00:02:08,403
after the Milburn report drops.

71
00:02:08,826 --> 00:02:11,486
Details on company size, exact disclosure

72
00:02:11,386 --> 00:02:13,546
format, and enforcement are missing.

73
00:02:13,953 --> 00:02:15,953
So we are waiting for a law that does not

74
00:02:15,853 --> 00:02:17,013
explain the law yet?

75
00:02:17,270 --> 00:02:19,630
Yes! But until then, employers are encouraged

76
00:02:19,530 --> 00:02:21,030
to disclose voluntarily.

77
00:02:21,446 --> 00:02:24,066
Great. I will just apply to 'hopeful salary'

78
00:02:23,966 --> 00:02:24,846
vacancies now.

79
00:02:25,002 --> 00:02:26,842
Please do not. Use your best guess instead.

80
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:29,259
The prime minister is also working on a

81
00:02:29,159 --> 00:02:31,680
10-year plan to end what he calls 40 years

82
00:02:31,580 --> 00:02:32,740
