83
00:02:32,906 --> 00:02:35,626
To end forty years of neoliberalism? That

84
00:02:35,526 --> 00:02:36,385
is a long wait.

85
00:02:36,674 --> 00:02:38,734
That plan could include bringing utilities

86
00:02:38,634 --> 00:02:41,433
under public control, but it may be delayed.

87
00:02:41,646 --> 00:02:44,227
So the salary rule comes first, then the

88
00:02:44,127 --> 00:02:44,686
big fix?

89
00:02:45,140 --> 00:02:47,260
At least now we can finally see what we

90
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:48,120
are signing up for.

91
00:02:48,275 --> 00:02:50,635
Exactly. No more playing 'guess the paycheck.'

92
00:02:50,882 --> 00:02:53,122
I still prefer my old game of 'ignore your

93
00:02:53,022 --> 00:02:53,381
rent.'

94
00:02:53,625 --> 00:02:55,324
Seriously? That is your plan?

95
00:02:55,740 --> 00:02:58,219
Mandatory salary disclosure aims to level

96
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:59,979
the playing field. But will it?

97
00:03:00,173 --> 00:03:02,853
We will see when the details drop. Subscribe

98
00:03:02,753 --> 00:03:03,453
for updates.
